      <rules>
        <rule name="Sneaky" id="c61-becd-e1a6-1b0" hidden="false">
          <description>Halfling Thieves can hide in the slightest shadow or piece of cover.


Halfling thieves always have a -1 to hit modifier when being shot at, this adds to any other modifiers.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
